<title>USA: IXC sells $300 mln exchangeable prfd stock.</title>
<headline>IXC sells $300 mln exchangeable prfd stock.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>IXC Communications Inc sold $300 million in junior subordinated exchangeable pay-in-kind preferred stock on Thursday, according to market sources.</p>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston priced the deal (Caa/CCC-plus) at par to yield 12.50 percent.</p>
<p>The offering was increased from an original size of $200 million in light of strong investor demand, the sources said.</p>
<p>((-Douglas Brown, U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1662))</p>
</text>
